/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358270/extras/8de128d5e5ad0cf7001cdd827b8cb130.avif?t=1750750405\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You've finished all the chapters that have been released and there's nothing left to do?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry. Galeid. is packed with so many hidden elements that even the creator doesn't fully understand them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can ask the residents, or investigate every suspicious place one by one,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and find the events that you don't understand in your own way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358270/extras/8116cc1337b3f530971fdf51ae4b641e.avif?t=1750750405\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, as of Chapter 1, there are a total of <strong>10 secret bosses!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you defeat all of the secret bosses, the game's current volume is about 4 to 5 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck with finding them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358270/extras/6173b7e2e127ea070964fe5c79d88863.avif?t=1750750405\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >!This game has a bug!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Major bugs have been fixed, but please make sure to back up your save data just in case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save data location:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local files \u2192\u300cwww\u300d\u2192\u300csave\u300d\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please read the terms and conditions before streaming, creating derivative works, or creating multilingual patches!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galeid. welcomes live commentary, streaming, derivative works, and volunteer translations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is possible to monetize live commentary and live streaming... but!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before doing so, please check the terms and conditions of the linked website first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a good look!!! (Sorry, no English translation)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
